### Assign Teacher to Subject in Class (admin)
# Requires: valid class_id, subject_id, teacher_id from your DB
POST http://localhost:3600/api/class-subjects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "class_id": 1,
  "subject_id": 1,
  "teacher_id": 2
}

###

### Get All Class-Subject Assignments
GET http://localhost:3600/api/class-subjects
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Reassign Teacher (admin)
PATCH http://localhost:3600/api/class-subjects/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "teacher_id": 3
}

###

### Remove Assignment (admin)
DELETE http://localhost:3600/api/class-subjects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}